# Deny-all build context: only what the Dockerfile actually COPYs gets in.
# This is a containment guarantee, not an optimization — .env, .sessions/,
# .git and everything else can never leak into an image layer.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!pyharness/
!deploy/container/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
